class GetCreditsOutput(TypedDict):
    """The answer of get_credits: the body of a successful call, as the API sent it."""

    plan: Literal["free", "starter", "creator", "studio", "unlimited"] | str
    """The plan of the account."""
    planRequired: bool
    """true when the account must choose a plan before it can spend its credits or export; reading works either way. While bonus.status is active, a call through the API still spends the bonus. It does not say whether the API may spend the plan credits: only the Creator and Studio plans can."""
    credits: GetCreditsOutputCredits
    """The plan credits and the top-up of the account. Analyses are paid in credits."""
    bonus: GetCreditsOutputBonus | None
    """The API bonus: credits given once to the account for using the API. It is not part of remaining. While status is active, a call through the API that costs credits spends the bonus before the plan credits and the top-up, even when planRequired is true; on any plan but Creator and Studio the bonus also pays for exports, Editor Assistant turns, tool runs and fake text scripts, within its own daily limits. A charge the bonus cannot cover in full is never split: on the Creator and Studio plans the plan pays it, and on any other plan it is refused. Every account can receive the bonus, whatever its plan. Calls from the GPT-Video app never spend it. null when the account never received one."""
    dailyLimits: GetCreditsOutputDailyLimits
    """The limits that count per day instead of per month."""


